        <mxCell id="pn" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Public auth routes (register, login, verify, forgot / reset, invitation token landing) skip the session guard but keep rate limit, CSRF and validation.&lt;br&gt;• Workspace-level resources (members, invitations, settings) skip the project-membership step.&lt;br&gt;• APP sessions are rejected on /platform/* and PLATFORM sessions on tenant routes (ADR-001/007).&lt;br&gt;• Error body: {code, message, details, requestId} (Arch §6)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa500;" vertex="1" parent="1">
